Package: diffofdiffs
Version: @PACKAGE_VERSION@
Section: devel
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCHITECTURE@
Maintainer: @MAINTAINER@
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: @SHLIBS_DEPENDS@, libgit2-1.9 (>= 1.9.1)
Homepage: https://github.com/ctrliq/diffofdiffs
Description: compare the changes made by two patches or Git commits
 Compare patch edits and surrounding source side by side in the terminal
 or in standalone HTML reports with embedded styles and viewing controls.
X-Publisher-Stream: @PUBLISHER_STREAM@
X-Build-Inputs-SHA256: @BUILD_INPUTS_SHA256@
